        "title": null
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Debezium provides at-least-once delivery guarantees. This means that no changes are missed; however, in some cases, a record may be delivered more than once. In certain scenarios, these duplicate records might be problematic, and exactly-once semantics may be required."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Exactly-once delivery ensures that every change is delivered and appears in the change stream no more than once. This is a significantly stricter requirement than at-least-once delivery."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Currently, Debezium does not implement an internal deduplication layer to enforce exactly-once semantics. However, when Debezium is deployed as a source connector in the Kafka Connect framework, it can take advantage of Kafka Connect’s support for exactly-once delivery."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
        "id": "_overview",
        "level": 1,
        "roles": [],
        "title": [
          {
            "kind": "text",
            "value": "Overview"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "blocks": [
          {
            "context": "paragraph",
            "id": null,
            "inlines": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Kafka Connect introduced support for exactly-once delivery for source connectors in "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "KIP-618"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "target": "https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-618%3A+Exactly-Once+Support+for+Source+Connectors"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": ". This functionality builds upon Kafka’s transaction support and the exactly-once delivery mechanism introduced in "
              },
              {
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "KIP-98"
                  }
                ],
                "kind": "link",
                "target": "https://cwiki.apache.org/confluence/display/KAFKA/KIP-98+-+Exactly+Once+Delivery+and+Transactional+Messaging"
              },
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "."
              }
            ],
            "roles": [],
            "title": null
          },
          {
            "blocks": [
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Although exactly-once delivery has been available in Kafka and Kafka Connect for some time, it remains unclear whether the implementation is fully correct or if there are edge cases where exactly-once semantics might be violated."
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              },
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "To date, no comprehensive study has analyzed the correctness of transaction and exactly-once implementations in recent Kafka releases. However, two "
                  },
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Jepsen"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "link",
                    "target": "https://jepsen.io"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " reports, one for "
                  },
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Redpanda"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "link",
                    "target": "https://jepsen.io/analyses/redpanda-21.10.1"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": " and another for "
                  },
                  {
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "Bufstream"
                      }
                    ],
                    "kind": "link",
                    "target": "https://jepsen.io/analyses/bufstream-0.1.0"
                  },
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": ", highlight potential issues with the Kafka protocol and its implementations. These reports raise concerns about correctness, particularly in the Bufstream case."
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              },
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "As a result, several related issues in Apache Kafka remain open:"
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              },
              {
                "context": "ulist",
                "id": null,
                "items": [
                  {
                    "blocks": [],
                    "checkbox": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "inlines": [
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "KAFKA-17734"
                          }
                        ],
                        "kind": "link",
                        "target": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17734"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "blocks": [],
                    "checkbox": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "inlines": [
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "KAFKA-17754"
                          }
                        ],
                        "kind": "link",
                        "target": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17754"
                      }
                    ]
                  },
                  {
                    "blocks": [],
                    "checkbox": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "inlines": [
                          {
                            "kind": "text",
                            "value": "KAFKA-17582"
                          }
                        ],
                        "kind": "link",
                        "target": "https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/KAFKA-17582"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "style": null,
                "title": null
              },
              {
                "context": "paragraph",
                "id": null,
                "inlines": [
                  {
                    "kind": "text",
                    "value": "Because Kafka Connect exactly-once delivery relies on Kafka transactions, it’s reasonable to assume that these issues might also affect Kafka Connect’s exactly-once guarantees."
                  }
                ],
                "roles": [],
                "title": null
              },
              {
                "blocks": [
                  {
                    "context": "paragraph",
                    "id": null,
                    "inlines": [
                      {
                        "kind": "text",
                        "value": "While there is no in-depth study which would analyse correctness of Kafka Connect exactly-once delivery, there are known issues in Kafka transaction protocol which may have impact also on the correctness of Kafka Connect exactly-once delivery."
                      }
                    ],
                    "roles": [],
                    "title": null
                  }
                ],
                "context": "admonition",
                "id": null,
                "roles": [],
                "title": null,
                "type": "warning"
              }
            ],
            "context": "section",
            "id": "_known_issues_and_considerations",
            "level": 2,
            "roles": [],
            "title": [
              {
                "kind": "text",
                "value": "Known issues and considerations"
              }
            ]
          }
        ],
        "context": "section",
